{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080460/extras/59cf39855a7dbc7c524eb37788038257.poster.avif?t=1765895433\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080460/extras/59cf39855a7dbc7c524eb37788038257.webm?t=1765895433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080460/extras/59cf39855a7dbc7c524eb37788038257.mp4?t=1765895433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It was just another ordinary day.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2018Lee Jian\u2019</i> is a\u00a0former student-athlete attending a high school tucked away in the desolate mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That day, she had simply fallen asleep at her desk, exhausted from studying as usual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when she opened her eyes again, her friends and teachers had all vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the 'School' seems to be twisted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar corridors were sealed off, and an endless stream of sludge wept down the walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, something in the shape of a student wanders within the shadows of the <i>'School'</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened while she was asleep?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or rather, is this even the school she once knew?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep this in mind: <strong>there is no safe place within the school anymore.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080460/extras/2d6e38f74fa281b3e06ef20d1cf47f9d.poster.avif?t=1765895433\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080460/extras/2d6e38f74fa281b3e06ef20d1cf47f9d.webm?t=1765895433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080460/extras/2d6e38f74fa281b3e06ef20d1cf47f9d.mp4?t=1765895433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scavenge. Survive. Endure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the school that was once her everyday life, search for an exit, and gather the resources necessary for survival.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even familiar paths can no longer be trusted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you face those \u2018things\u2019 empty-handed, death is certain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It may be a pitiful weapon, but clutch the mop as if it were your last hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet a single mop will never be enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are injured, you must find a way to treat your wounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search every possible hiding place\u2014inside cabinets, beneath desks, within the cold metal of lockers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure every scrap you can. Only the prepared are granted the right to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080460/extras/9e3509f1b7ca40c7a80293bd5adf2ed8.poster.avif?t=1765895433\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080460/extras/9e3509f1b7ca40c7a80293bd5adf2ed8.webm?t=1765895433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080460/extras/9e3509f1b7ca40c7a80293bd5adf2ed8.mp4?t=1765895433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find the Clues. Escape the School.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the traces of the vanished students. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps they will lead you not only to an escape route but to the chilling truth behind this nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The school hasn't just changed its structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doorways are missing, hallways spontaneously seal her path, and the corridor repeats in an endless loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this place that seems to be alive, she may ultimately have to confront the school itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>May your \u2018Way Back Home\u2019 be a safe one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4080460?t=1765895433","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4080460?t=1765895433","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080460/87f44c2a92f2d96d9f3ff71da3f67b4bdbf0591a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765895433","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080460/87f44c2a92f2d96d9f3ff71da3f67b4bdbf0591a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765895433","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages: Realistic violence and fear elements"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080460/e